## Turn: continuous perf + Graph.Tests crash resolution

### Correctness/crash (MAJOR)
- `5152934` Graph.Tests nondeterministic suite crash RESOLVED. Root cause was
  NOT pre-existing heap corruption needing ASan: TwoSat test
  Solve_EdgeCaseSingleVariableSelfImplication sized to[]/next[] to maxEdges=2,
  but 1 clause = 2 implication edges, which under Convention-A 1-based edge
  indexing occupy indices 1 AND 2. Index 2 overran the size-2 buffer ->
  heap corruption -> delayed AV (18-27 tests in). Fix: size maxEdges+1.
  Graph.Tests now 36/36 DETERMINISTIC across 5 runs. LAST known failure gone.
  Full suite: 1217/1217, 0 fail, 0 crash.

